# =============================================================================
# Grafo Concierge - Ingestion & Watcher Exclusion Rules (.conciergeignore.example)
# =============================================================================
# WHAT IS THIS FILE?
# ------------------
# .conciergeignore defines custom exclusion rules specifically for Grafo Concierge.
# It uses standard .gitignore / pathspec syntax.
#
# WHY USE .conciergeignore INSTEAD OF JUST .gitignore?
# ----------------------------------------------------
# 1. Grafo Concierge automatically respects your project's .gitignore and built-in
#    defaults (like .git/, node_modules/, __pycache__/, .env*).
# 2. However, there may be files that you DO want tracked in Git, but DO NOT want
#    indexed into the Grafo Concierge Knowledge Graph / Vector Memory.
#    Examples: large test fixtures, generated documentation, minified bundles,
#    benchmark datasets, or third-party vendored code.
# 3. Excluding unneeded files saves vector embedding costs, accelerates AST parsing,
#    and keeps agent search results razor-sharp without semantic noise.
# 4. The Early-Exit Reactive Watcher filters filesystem events against these rules
#    before hitting disk I/O, preventing CPU spikes.
#
# USAGE:
# ------
# Copy this file to '.conciergeignore' in your project root:
#   cp .conciergeignore.example .conciergeignore
# =============================================================================

# ── 1. Large Test Fixtures & Mock Datasets ──
# Keep in git for tests, but exclude from AI graph indexing
tests/fixtures/
tests/data/
*.mock.json
*.fixtures.*
*.sample.*

# ── 2. Heavy Data, Models & Dumps ──
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.onnx
*.pkl
*.dump
*.sql.gz

# ── 3. Build Artifacts & Minified Bundles ──
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.bundle.js
*.map
static/vendor/
public/assets/

# ── 4. Documentation Assets & Media ──
docs/assets/
docs/images/
*.pdf
*.drawio

# ── 5. Scratch & One-off Scripts ──
# Prevent scratch files from cluttering the agent's architectural memory
scratch/
experiments/
sandbox/
_scratch_*
tmp_*.py
